          "id": "sec-product-knowledge",
          "title": "04 · 產品科普",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "content-box",
              "title": "儲存技術 vs 介面標準",
              "paragraphs": [
                "DRAM 和 NAND 是兩種底層儲存技術，分別搭配不同的介面標準決定傳輸方式與連接位置。"
              ],
              "table": {
                "headers": ["儲存技術", "", "介面標準", "連接方式", "頻寬"],
                "alignRight": [],
                "rows": [
                  ["DRAM", "→", "**HBM3e**", "封裝在 GPU 旁，1024-bit 超寬匯流排", "~3.35 TB/s"],
                  ["DRAM", "→", "**DDR5**", "插在主機板記憶體插槽，64-bit 匯流排", "~400 GB/s"],
                  ["DRAM", "→", "**CXL**", "跑在 PCIe 線路上，支援跨機共享記憶體池", "~64 GB/s"],
                  ["NAND", "→", "**NVMe（PCIe Gen5）**", "插在主機板 SSD 插槽，GPU 可直讀（GPUDirect）", "~7 GB/s / drive"],
                  ["NAND", "→", "**SATA**", "舊式介面，消費級 / 傳統企業用", "~0.6 GB/s"]
                ]
              },
              "id": "blk-storage-interface"
            },
            {
              "type": "content-box",
              "title": "AI Data Center 儲存架構",
              "image": {
                "src": "/images/equity-research/SNDK/ai-datacenter-storage-hierarchy.webp",
                "alt": "AI Data Center Storage Hierarchy — Compute Cluster (Processors, HBM, DRAM, Local SSDs) to Storage Cluster (Network SSDs, Network hard drives)"
              },
              "paragraphs": [
                "AI 資料在 Data Center 中經過多層儲存設備處理。Compute Cluster 內的 Processors 搭配 HBM、DRAM 和 Local SSDs（TLC）提供高效能運算；Storage Cluster 由 Network SSDs（QLC）和 Network hard drives 組成，負責大容量資料儲存。Sandisk 的產品覆蓋 Local SSDs（TLC Enterprise SSD）和 Network SSDs（Stargate QLC eSSD）兩個層級。"
              ],
              "sources": [
                {
                  "label": "Seagate Technology, 2024",
                  "href": "https://www.viksnewsletter.com/p/role-of-storage-in-ai-primer-on-nand#:~:text=the%20picture%20below.-,Source%3A%20Seagate,-In%20this%20article"
                }
              ],
              "id": "blk-ai-dc-storage"
            }
          ]
        },
